<ui:UXML xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements" xmlns:uie="UnityEditor.UIElements" xsi:schemaLocation="UnityEngine.UIElements ../../UIElementsSchema/UnityEngine.UIElements.xsd" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" editor-extension-mode="False">
    <Style src="project:/Assets/UI/Styles/GlobalStyles.uss" />
    <ui:VisualElement name="result-overlay" class="overlay">
        <ui:VisualElement name="result-container" class="card" style="width: 90%; max-width: 480px; align-items: center; background-color: rgba(15, 10, 30, 0.85); border-width: 2px; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border-radius: 32px; padding: 40px 30px;">
            <ui:Label name="result-title" text="KẾT QUẢ" style="font-size: 52px; color: white; -unity-font-style: bold; margin-bottom: 25px; letter-spacing: 2px;" />
            <ui:Label name="win-label" text="" style="font-size: 36px; color: #ffea00; -unity-font-style: bold; -unity-text-align: middle-center; margin-bottom: 30px; white-space: normal;" />

            <ui:VisualElement name="score-container" style="width: 100%; flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <ui:Label name="your-score-label" text="Điểm của bạn: 0" style="color: white; font-size: 28px;" />
                <ui:Label name="opp-score-label" text="Điểm đối thủ: 0" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-size: 28px;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <ui:VisualElement name="reward-container" style="flex-direction: row; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 35px; background-color: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.10); border-radius: 16px; padding: 12px 24px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.20);">
                <ui:Label text="&#9733;" style="color: #FFD166; font-size: 30px; margin-right: 10px;" />
                <ui:Label name="reward-label" text="Thưởng: 0" style="color: #FFD166; font-size: 28px; -unity-font-style: bold;" />
                <ui:Label text="&#9733;" style="color: #FFD166; font-size: 30px; margin-left: 10px;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <ui:Button name="play-again-btn" text="CHƠI LẠI" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; font-size: 30px; height: 70px; border-radius: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;" />
            <ui:Button name="home-btn" text="VỀ TRANG CHỦ" class="btn btn-cancel" style="width: 100%; font-size: 24px; height: 60px; border-radius: 16px;" />
        </ui:VisualElement>
    </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>
